      "type": "text",
      "x": 761.374383504549,
      "y": 318.81897296072896,
      "width": 942.8793334960938,
      "height": 350,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 2,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b11",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1943550626,
      "version": 398,
      "versionNonce": 147871010,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1786367022608,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "4- follow the installation wizard \n\n    - borwser login\n    - npm istallation\n    - route Sentry request in Nextjs server (yes)\n    - enable Tracing to track (yes)\n    - enable Session Replay to get a video-like reproduction of errors during a user session (yes)\n    - enable Logs to send your application logs to Sentry (yes)\n    - create an example page (\"/sentry-example-page\") to test your Sentry setup (yes)\n    - Are you using a CI/CD tool to build and deploy your application? (yes)\n        -- copy the generate \"SENTRY_AUTH_TOKEN\" to the env.local\n    - Did you configure CI as shown above? (yes)\n    - done\n    ",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "4- follow the installation wizard \n\n    - borwser login\n    - npm istallation\n    - route Sentry request in Nextjs server (yes)\n    - enable Tracing to track (yes)\n    - enable Session Replay to get a video-like reproduction of errors during a user session (yes)\n    - enable Logs to send your application logs to Sentry (yes)\n    - create an example page (\"/sentry-example-page\") to test your Sentry setup (yes)\n    - Are you using a CI/CD tool to build and deploy your application? (yes)\n        -- copy the generate \"SENTRY_AUTH_TOKEN\" to the env.local\n    - Did you configure CI as shown above? (yes)\n    - done\n    ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "zCyE0RfAG8U83FKGOg0Sj",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 787.3743682457599,
      "y": 787.0689805901235,
      "width": 851.7393798828125,
      "height": 50,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 2,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b15",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1100874210,
      "version": 236,
      "versionNonce": 986901831,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1786371488679,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1- create demo simulation to throw errors from client, api route & background function.\n2- go to sentry.io/issues/projectId, and see the logs of the errors.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1- create demo simulation to throw errors from client, api route & background function.\n2- go to sentry.io/issues/projectId, and see the logs of the errors.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "H-VhXZ6shWZ7wbb34AFn_",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 784.6243911339435,
      "y": 870.8189996636098,
      "width": 884.7394409179688,
      "height": 50,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 2,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b16",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1338781246,
      "version": 298,
      "versionNonce": 1108520617,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1786371488679,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "NOTE: Sentry will show the normal \"client & api route\" normally and directly in \"feeds logs\",\n         but the background jobs errors needs middleware between sentry & ingest",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "NOTE: Sentry will show the normal \"client & api route\" normally and directly in \"feeds logs\",\n         but the background jobs errors needs middleware between sentry & ingest",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "NUG4QQxv5R0qiXXal71RW",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 802.6244369103107,
      "y": 1745.8191236412708,
      "width": 653.2396240234375,
      "height": 50,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 2,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b16V",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2137955305,
      "version": 677,
      "versionNonce": 127529161,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1786371624443,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "NOTE: the \"background job\" needs to be completely failed after all\n         \"retries\" to show up on Sentry feeds.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "NOTE: the \"background job\" needs to be completely failed after all\n         \"retries\" to show up on Sentry feeds.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
