      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1786441339845,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "\"Structured logs allow you to send, view and query logs sent from your applications within Sentry.\"\n- logs waht the user was trying to do by giving some logging information\n- whenever user clicks a function, trigger background jobs ...",
      "fontSize": 20,
