      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "\"Structured logs allow you to send, view and query logs sent from your applications within Sentry.\"\n- logs waht the user was trying to do by giving some logging information\n- whenever user clicks a function, trigger background jobs ...",
